<h3>Limits</h3>
<ul>
<li>One model (qwen3-4b), one prompt, one tensor-parallel setting, CPU attention. The FPGA attention path was not measured here (the issue's table shows PR 4959 identical to main under FPGA attention, which the row-major tail block explains).</li>
<li>The AMX add order was found by experiment on one Xeon 6962P; Intel's manual does not promise it across implementations.</li>
<li>The replay models the AMX kernels' internal order; its numbers for the AMX arms are model numbers, validated against the logged WO records at the o_proj's own rounding floor.</li>
